      <div class="container-1280">
        <h2 data-w-id="40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1afe8" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix left lim-10">Questions we're asked about<span class="gradient-text"> ordering at the table via QR code</span>:</h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1afed-6643cbb8" data-w-id="40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1afed" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does table ordering via QR code work?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Your customers scan the QR code at their table, view your menu, place their order, and pay using their smartphone—or at the register if they prefer. The order is sent instantly to the kitchen, to your printer, or to your order display. Once it’s ready, you serve it at the table, or your customer picks it up at the counter.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1aff8-6643cbb8" data-w-id="40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1aff8" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Why equip your restaurant with a QR code?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Table ordering streamlines your service and boosts your sales. At restaurants equipped with this system, we’ve seen an average increase of 19% in average check size, 11% in the number of orders, and a time savings of 12 minutes per table. With your staff freed from taking orders and handling payments, they can focus on welcoming guests and providing excellent service. <br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1b003-6643cbb8" data-w-id="40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1b003" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Do customers need to download an app to order from their table using Innovorder?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Your customers don't have to download anything. All they need is a smartphone capable of scanning a QR code and an Internet connection to access the link generated by the QR code.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1b00e-6643cbb8" data-w-id="40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1b00e" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can customers pay in cash?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. Your customers place their orders using the QR code, then pay at the counter—in cash or by card—whichever they prefer.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1b019-6643cbb8" data-w-id="40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1b019" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How is the seating plan respected?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Your waiters won't make any mistakes when serving the dishes, since each table is associated with a QR code via a unique table number.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-cfcff3d7-c05d-a655-d982-f127609af1f3-6643cbb8" data-w-id="cfcff3d7-c05d-a655-d982-f127609af1f3" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I customize the interface to reflect my restaurant's identity?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, the interface is fully customizable. You can adjust colors, fonts and images to perfectly match your brand and provide a unique experience for your customers.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_884da500-9fd5-82b9-a9cc-f3e03f680e88-6643cbb8" data-w-id="884da500-9fd5-82b9-a9cc-f3e03f680e88" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can I modify my menu on my own?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Absolutely! You can modify your dishes, adjust prices, set up new special offers and adapt your menu in just a few clicks, directly from your backoffice.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-beed2aed-327a-8b30-5b9c-6b96ed306b69-6643cbb8" data-w-id="beed2aed-327a-8b30-5b9c-6b96ed306b69" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Do my customers need to create an account to order?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No, our solution is designed to deliver a fast, frictionless experience. No account is required, just a first name to identify and retrieve an order.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_65838275-8470-8cff-faaf-e0cbb0dcb7bc-6643cbb8" data-w-id="65838275-8470-8cff-faaf-e0cbb0dcb7bc" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Which payment methods are accepted?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Your customers can pay from their smartphones using a credit card, Apple Pay, Google Pay, or digital meal vouchers (Swile, Edenred, etc.). In institutional dining settings, your guests can also pay with their digital wallets. Each person pays for their own order and receives a receipt by email. Payment at the register is still an option.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-a7a35ebd-b547-c865-821a-c9553efaeeee-6643cbb8" data-w-id="a7a35ebd-b547-c865-821a-c9553efaeeee" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How much does the Click &amp; Serve solution cost?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The Click &amp; Serve license is available starting at €139 per month, excluding tax.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-becf8da8-9ac1-44fd-4522-d201d222acc9-6643cbb8" data-w-id="becf8da8-9ac1-44fd-4522-d201d222acc9" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Do you need an Innovorder terminal to use Click &amp; Serve?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No. Click &amp; Serve works with the order-taking module, which is installed on a tablet or computer. When paired with an Innovorder point-of-sale system, it automatically synchronizes your orders with your other sales channels.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-c46d8b4e-5874-4f7c-83e7-efb2bf1bc073-6643cbb8" data-w-id="c46d8b4e-5874-4f7c-83e7-efb2bf1bc073" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>For which types of establishments is Click &amp; Serve suitable?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Click &amp; Serve is designed for establishments with at least 20 seats: fast-food restaurants, bars and pubs, recreational venues such as bowling alleys, campgrounds, and amusement parks, and franchises. It is also used in institutional food service. Do you manage a food court? Discover <a href="/en/innovorder-foodcourt"><strong>Innovorder Foodcourt</strong></a>, featuring a single shopping cart for all stalls.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-bc14114a-6283-c6ea-c77d-72aaacd14b40-6643cbb8" data-w-id="bc14114a-6283-c6ea-c77d-72aaacd14b40" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What do you need to install Click &amp; Serve?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">A tablet or computer to receive orders, a printer or a display in the kitchen, and a 4G or Wi-Fi connection for your customers. Your advisor will set up the solution remotely, and one hour of training is all it takes.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_2e300a9c-9e7e-6ebf-168e-dc91bbf52772-6643cbb8" data-w-id="2e300a9c-9e7e-6ebf-168e-dc91bbf52772" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What is the difference between Click &amp; Serve and the control pad?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">With Click &amp; Serve, your customers place their own orders from their smartphones by scanning the QR code at their table. With the <a href="/en/pad-de-commande"><strong>order pad</strong></a>, your servers take orders in the dining room using a tablet. Both solutions can be used together in the same restaurant.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-b464525b-f85b-45d9-b776-e4a976bf6261-6643cbb8" data-w-id="b464525b-f85b-45d9-b776-e4a976bf6261" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What if some of my customers don't want to use their smartphones?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Click &amp; Serve is a complementary ordering channel: it does not replace your counter service or table service. Customers who prefer to order at the counter or pay in cash can still do so.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_8e1b6403-17b0-7537-e4a7-08d1603b679d-6643cbb8" data-w-id="8e1b6403-17b0-7537-e4a7-08d1603b679d" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Can my customers place multiple orders at the same table?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes. For a second round or dessert, just scan the order again: each order goes straight to the kitchen.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div><div class="section cta-kiosk">
      <div data-w-id="40b3482e-f382-9dfa-0f72-c556f6d1b030" style="opacity:0" class="middle-section-wrapper">
